@startuml
' Figure 4.5 – Class diagram, Sprint 2: editor, AI interactions and raw events
!include _style.puml
skinparam nodesep 18
skinparam ranksep 45
hide circle
hide methods

class User {
  - id : UUID
  - plan : Plan
  - aiTokensRemaining : Integer
  - aiTokensResetAt : Timestamp
}
class Article {
  - id : UUID
  - content : Json
  - contentSearch : TsVector
  - wordCount : Integer
  - readTime : Integer
  - thumbnailUrl : String
}
class AiInteraction {
  - id : UUID
  - actionType : AiActionType
  - inputText : Text
  - outputText : Text
  - tokensUsed : Integer
  - model : String
}
class AnalyticsEvent {
  - id : UUID
  - eventType : AnalyticsEventType
  - metadata : Json
  - createdAt : Timestamp
}

class AiActionType <<Enumeration>> {
  chat
  inline_reformulate
  inline_shorten
  inline_expand
  inline_simplify
  inline_improve
  voice_transcribe
  portfolio_insight
}
class AnalyticsEventType <<Enumeration>> {
  view
  scroll
  time_on_page
  like
  comment
  repost
}
class Plan <<Enumeration>> {
  free
  premium
}

User "1" -- "0..*" Article : writes
User "1" -- "0..*" AiInteraction : triggers
Article "0..1" -- "0..*" AiInteraction : is the context of
Article "1" -- "0..*" AnalyticsEvent : is measured by
User "0..1" -- "0..*" AnalyticsEvent : viewer

note as N1
  voice_transcribe exists in the enumeration but has
  no implementation: voice input was descoped in the
  2026-07-26 re-baseline and is reported as future work.
end note

AiActionType -[hidden]down- AnalyticsEventType
AnalyticsEventType -[hidden]down- Plan
@enduml
